WEBVTT

00:00.120 --> 00:02.440
We don't have that much to give you

00:02.520 --> 00:03.520
See the guest out

00:03.600 --> 00:05.000
One thousand sets of armor

00:05.080 --> 00:06.280
Eight hundred warhorses

00:06.360 --> 00:07.760
Sixty days of rations

00:10.560 --> 00:11.920
Still too much

00:14.120 --> 00:15.520
Eight hundred

00:15.680 --> 00:17.600
I only need eight hundred sets of armor

00:17.760 --> 00:19.040
Five hundred warhorses

00:19.160 --> 00:20.560
Thirty days of rations

00:20.760 --> 00:21.640
People die

00:21.720 --> 00:22.720
I fight

00:22.800 --> 00:23.640
Seven days

00:23.800 --> 00:26.720
I'll help you block Qingzhou Army for seven days
